WEBVTT

00:02:56.735 --> 00:03:00.234
[Ieskicējam saskarni.]

00:03:04.268 --> 00:03:11.537
(Mūzika)

00:03:15.335 --> 00:03:17.035
(Smiekli)

00:03:17.035 --> 00:03:19.811
(Aplausi)

00:03:23.511 --> 00:03:26.508
Diezgan kolosāli, vai ne?
Arī mēs tā domājam.

00:03:26.508 --> 00:03:30.292
Nu, kad esam izstrādājuši šos rīkus